OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover could be removed under
OL,4,Acouncil master plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Birmingham's most recognisable
OL,7,Flandmarks could be removed in the
OL,8,Fcoming years under a council
OL,9,Fdevelopment master plan.
OL,11,FThe Hockley Flyover, which opened in
OL,12,F1968 to relieve congestion, was
OL,13,Fdescribed by Birmingham City Council as
OL,14,Fa "major obstacle" in its draft Local
OL,15,FPlan - which is currently under
OL,16,Fconsultation.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
