OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover could be removed under
OL,4,Acouncil master plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the flyover, which has
OL,7,Fa sunken concourse that is home to
OL,8,Fthree Grade II listed concrete murals,
OL,9,Frestricted pedestrians, prioritised
OL,10,Ftraffic and contributed to a "poor
OL,11,Fpublic realm".
OL,13,FProposals to either remove or remodel
OL,14,Fit would reconnect nearby communities
OL,15,Fand unlock land for new residential
OL,16,Fneighbourhoods, the plan argued.
